# Direct runtime dependencies for llm-honeypot (local detection pipeline +
# Phase B semantic layer).
# Compile with: uv pip compile --universal --python-version 3.10 --generate-hashes requirements.in -o requirements.txt
#
# ai-firewall (Phase B judge) CANNOT live in this file: the lockfile is
# hash-checked and pip's hash mode refuses VCS URLs. It installs as a separate
# pinned step — full SHA, --no-deps, same pattern as security-gate in CI:
#   pip install --no-deps "ai-firewall @ git+https://github.com/LeightonSec/ai-firewall@54e72a212a2838beec0f0988bc9e86e7bad9a611"
# Its library deps are therefore pinned HERE, under the hashed lockfile, and
# must mirror ai-firewall's pyproject (bump together on any SHA bump):
